close: the closed tab entry carries the latest draft
close: the draft entry does not carry run=1
close+back: the recreated tab restores the draft
close+back: the run result snapshot is kept
back: a newer unrun draft is preserved
back: the editor shows the draft
back: the entry result snapshot is adopted
forward: the draft survives the round-trip
forward: the entry result snapshot is adopted
param back: the draft query is preserved
param back: the draft params are preserved
param back: the param inputs keep the draft bindings
param forward: the draft query survives the round-trip
param forward: the draft params survive the round-trip
clean param back: the entry query is restored
clean param back: the entry params are restored verbatim
clean param forward: the entry query is restored
clean param forward: the entry params are restored verbatim
back with a clean editor: the entry query is restored
forward with a clean editor: the entry query is restored
